ring stunts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2055590/extras/acc74507401c8bfd088ff3b3a98a5f79.poster.avif?t=1751450183\" width=614 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2055590/extras/acc74507401c8bfd088ff3b3a98a5f79.webm?t=1751450183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2055590/extras/acc74507401c8bfd088ff3b3a98a5f79.mp4?t=1751450183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race across breathtaking landscapes and uncover the truth behind your lover’s disappearance in this shattered world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the whispering dunes to the gravity bending ruins, every biome is a challenge, demanding speed, precision, and creative thinking.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your journey is yours to shape!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you harness your abilities to defy physics, outmaneuver threats, or unlock the lost knowledge buried beneath the land?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A HEARTFELT TRIBUTE TO THE GENRE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed by a passionate indie team of 10, <i>Star Overdrive</i> combines the thrill of high-speed traversal with immersive storytelling, offering a fresh take on the action-adventure genre.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to dive into a world where music, momentum, and mystery intertwine.</p>", "short_description": "Star Overdrive is a high-speed action adventure set in an open world. Race across an alien planet on your Hoverboard, mastering tricks, battling enemies, solving puzzles, and using your powers to overcome challenges and shape your destiny!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Simplified Chinese,